msgid ""
"A chapter counts as finished after you or KOReader mark it finished and you "
"close it, or you manually mark it read in the plugin. Reaching the last page "
"alone does not count unless KOReader marks the chapter finished. Old read "
"status alone does not trigger deletion. A finished chapter without a "
"downloaded file still counts toward the keep limit, but a file downloaded "
"later is not deleted for that earlier finish."
msgstr ""
"在您或 KOReader 将章节标记为读完并关闭章节后，或您在插件中手动将章节标为已读"
"后，该章节才算读完。仅翻到最后一页不算，除非 KOReader 将章节标记为读完。仅有"
"旧的已读状态不会触发删除。没有下载文件的读完章节仍计入保留数量，但之后下载的"
"文件不会因之前的读完记录而被删除。"

