msgid ""
"Check again checks which unread chapters need downloading. It does not retry "
"failed chapters or cancel pending deletion. Turn off auto-download prevents "
"future automatic additions; queued and running downloads continue. Cancel "
"stops the current check for that manga, and Cancel all stops all current "
"checks. Auto-download stays enabled after cancellation and can run again "
"after reading or chapter actions."
msgstr ""
"“重新检查”会检查哪些未读章节需要下载。它不会重试下载失败的章节，也不会取消待"
"执行的删除。“关闭自动下载”阻止之后自动添加下载；已排队和正在进行的下载会继"
"续。“取消”停止该漫画的当前检查，“全部取消”停止所有当前检查。取消后自动下载仍"
"保持启用，可以在阅读或章节操作后再次运行。"

msgid ""
