msgid ""
"Download next adds up to the chosen number of new unread downloads once. "
"Auto-download fills the first unread chapters up to its limit; downloaded "
"and queued chapters count. Both use source order and your saved scanlator "
"filter, not your current chapter. Auto-download does not delete other "
"downloads. Bulk actions add at most 50 new downloads."
msgstr ""
"“下载接下来”一次性添加未读章节的新下载，数量不超过所选值。自动下载补齐最前面"
"的未读章节，直到达到上限；已下载和已排队的章节都计入数量。两者都使用源中的顺"
"序和已保存的汉化组筛选条件，而不从当前章节开始。自动下载不会删除其他已下载文"
"件。批量操作最多新增 50 个下载。"

