msgid ""
"Marking a chapter read can succeed even if its file cannot be deleted. "
"Manual mark-read deletion preserves reading data and backups. Marking the "
"chapter unread cancels pending deletion. A new Download or Retry action also "
"cancels it once accepted; failed requests and automatic downloads do not."
msgstr ""
"即使章节文件无法删除，仍可成功标为已读。手动标为已读后执行的删除会保留阅读数"
"据和备份。将章节标为未读会取消待执行的删除。新的“下载”或“重试”操作在请求被接"
"受后也会取消删除；失败的请求和自动下载不会取消删除。"

